		<div class='content-text keep-font'>
			<div style="padding: 10px 30px !important;">
				<h1>Insured</h1>
				<h2>Amerijet (810) Air Waybill - Insured</h2>
				<p>Filing deadline for concealed damage claim 14 days from the date of delivery for damage, shortage, or pilferage claims; 120 days for claims involving non-delivery. Claims filed later are subject to denial.</p>
				<p>Inspection procedure For potential claims in excess of $1,000, we reserve the right to send a surveyor to examine the cargo.</p>
				<p>Initial notification of claim: <a href=" https://mycargo.amerijet.com/doclibrary/documents/7seasClaim.html" target="_blank">Use the Claim Letter form</a>.</p>
				<h3 style="margin: 0px 0px 10px;">Required documents to support claim:</h3>
				<ul>
					<li class="text">Formal claim letter, stating dollar amount of claim (in U.S. Dollars).</li>
					<li class="text">Copy of original invoice.</li>
					<li class="text">Copy of Commercial Invoice.</li>
					<li class="text">Copy of Packing List on shipment, indicating lost or damaged items.</li>
					<li class="text">Shipper's Letter of Instruction.</li>
					<li class="text">Original Air Waybill.</li>
					<li class="text">Copy of Delivery Receipt(s).</li>
					<li class="text">Surveyor's damage report.</li>
					<li class="text">Copy(ies) of discrepancy certificates and out-turn reports.</li>
					<li class="text">Condemnation certificates (if applicable).</li>
					<li class="text">Photos of damaged item(s), if available (required for claims exceeding $750).</li>
					<li class="text">Other relevant information pertaining to shortage or damages.</li>
				</ul>
				<p>Depending on the type and extent of the loss, Seven Seas Insurance may require additional documents to substantiate your claim.</p>
				<h2>Have Questions? Call 1-800-927-6059</h2>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class='content-text keep-font'>
			<div style="padding: 10px 30px !important;">
				<h1>Not Insured</h1>
				<h2>Amerijet Air Waybill | Not Insured</h2>
				<div>Read the procedures for making a claim with Amerijet.</div>
				<h2>Claim Procedure</h2>
				<p>Filing deadline for Concealed Damage Claim<br>
				14 days from the date of delivery for damage, shortage, or pilferage claims;<br>
				120 days for claims involving non-delivery.<br>
				Claims filed later are subject to denial.</p>
				<p>We reserve the right to send a surveyor to examine the cargo.</p>
				<p><span>Initial Notification of Claims</span></p>
				<h3>Submit your claim through CargoClaims by going through Access Gate (This page).<br />Required fields:</h3>
				<ul>
					<li class="text">Name of Shipper.</li>
					<li class="text">Name of Consignee.</li>
					<li class="text">Air Waybill number.</li>
					<li class="text">Date shipment was delivered to air carrier.</li>
					<li class="text">Carrier name and flight number.</li>
					<li class="text">Port of departure and destination.</li>
					<li class="text">Description of the goods shipped, and their value (if known).</li>
				</ul>
				<h3>Required Documents to support your Claim submission</h3>
				<ul>
					<li class="text">Copy of initial notification of claim.</li>
					<li class="text">Formal claim letter</li>
					<li class="text">Dollar amount of claim (in U.S. Dollars)</li>
					<li class="text">Copy of original invoice.</li>
					<li class="text">Copy of Commercial Invoice.</li>
					<li class="text">Packing List on shipment, indicating lost or damaged items.</li>
					<li class="text">Shipper's Letter of Instruction.</li>
					<li class="text">Master Air Waybill.</li>
					<li class="text">House Air Waybill (for consolidations).</li>
					<li class="text">Transfer Manifest (for interline shipments).</li>
					<li class="text">Freight charges collected, if known.</li>
					<li class="text">Copy of Warehouse Receipt or equivalent.</li>
					<li class="text">Copy of Delivery Receipt(s).</li>
					<li class="text">Cargo damage report.</li>
					<li class="text">Surveyor's damage report.</li>
					<li class="text">Copy(s) of discrepancy certificates and out-turn reports.</li>
					<li class="text">Condemnation certificates (if applicable).</li>
					<li class="text">Photos of damaged item(s) and of non-delivered freight, if available (required for claims exceeding $750).</li>
					<li class="text">Damage repair estimate (for damage claims only).</li>
					<li class="text">Landing Certificate/Customs Declaration.</li>
					<li class="text">Letter of subrogation (if the right to the claim is transferred to a third party).</li>
					<li class="text">Other relevant information pertaining to shortage or damages.</li>
				</ul>
				<p><span>Note:</span>Depending on the type and extent of the loss, Amerijet may require additional documents to substantiate your claim.</p>
				<h2>Have Questions? Call 1-800-927-6059</h2>
			</div>
